{"id":175,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为庆祝中国共产党成立105周年、红军长征胜利90周年，弘扬伟大建党精神，锤炼党员干部党性修养，引导青年学生骨干厚植报国情怀，7月3日，校团委党支部和青年马克思主义者培养工程大学生骨干红色研学实践团近40人赴长治黄崖洞红色教育基地开展主题党日暨红色研学实践活动。</p><p>全体师生走进黄崖洞革命遗址，沉浸式回顾了太行军民不畏强敌、浴血奋战、艰苦奋斗、自力更生的抗战历程，深入学习老一辈军工革命者扎根深山、为国铸器、坚守阵地的初心使命，深刻领会不怕牺牲、不畏艰险，百折不挠、艰苦奋斗，万众一心、敢于胜利，英勇奋斗、无私奉献的伟大太行精神。</p><p>在烈士陵园前，全体师生列队肃立、静默致哀，怀着崇高的敬意向革命先烈敬献鲜花，深切缅怀在黄崖洞保卫战中英勇牺牲的革命烈士与老一辈兵工建设者，追忆先辈们舍生取义、强军报国的光辉事迹。</p><p>此次红色研学活动，是一堂生动的户外思政实践课。既进一步夯实了团委党员的党性根基，强化责任担当；也帮助青马学员汲取红色精神养分，筑牢理想信念。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-L4GWZLmf7MRGYoH7C4nmQfUNVRnzLgiMN7DoRUPnmGDLRN0gihFp2hmCIa0okhRLYysU1hkLN7PU4r2nRUPoR-4n7nVU8l4L4l8nmfRolVFMRUYUmQVUzAFM8CYnzGJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMzvagtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7570&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8C37BB2A1C5FD41823DDECE3354F0C9A/442B6EA8/7F2E0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nRvWaM8QfUNUYLH4U4Uz7aUzMVM4AgVLmCsMlr2LR98n7C0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkM1hVLkh2UzCsM8-ao7C8L4LDU4NYLR9iLRvPMRMVMRTFUl7sLmV2M8nFUN-boRCJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMzvagtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7570&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-M7QWknzU4MmN4oHzV2oRQfL87iM8LgYMNnfM7MkUzU4nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZMky4LYyPMlWkMR98LmNbU49aMNUYL8UYMNnVnN7bLmMFUmvZMNMfozVFM4T2UlCJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMzvagtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7570&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8843315BB484299C806D23D26DEFA923/B786CA91/79FAF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-U49WDMm9aLzvsMH4vaozvaUmG8LmAg7M4CYnNLDUzUPMmN0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYokh7L1yaolUaUNCbMRQVUlrfozl8MzAVUNWVLzU8oR6FM8CDoRCaMlWFM498o77bgtXaQ4Oeo4x86YhXptQ0g47aL4-0M4lsLkbw62L8c&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7570&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nlCWbLmvsozLDMHmVVLRvDM4UbLzNgDnzQRMzlPolCZM7l0gihFp2hmCIa0USysMSysUSy8LRf7Lm7aLR9ZM8V7M4UbLlrVL4UZMz-sLmMFUN-4nNUYL7VFM8W7LmLJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMzvagtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7570&e=.jpg\" vsbhr